Revision history for Game-Snake

0.12    2026-10-11
        - Rewritten as an engine: Game::Snake plays the game and draws nothing.
        - Game::Snake::Terminal and bin/snake: the game in a terminal.
        - Game::Snake::Bot: two levels, greedy and flood-fill; snake --watch.
        - Game::Snake::Raylib: the window of 0.11, now optional (perl 5.38+).
        - Raylib::FFI and Term::ReadKey are recommended, not required.

0.11    2026-07-18
        - Remove PAX headers

0.01    2024-12-29
        - First version.
